<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan passes on T$10 bln in treasury bills.</title>
<headline>Taiwan passes on T$10 bln in treasury bills.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's finance ministry said it passed on Wednesday's auction of T$10 billion in 91-day treasury bills because the bids failed to reach the base price.</p>
<p>Demand totalled T$20.9 billion, a ministry statement said.</p>
<p>The central bank completed the auction on behalf of the finance ministry.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (886-2-5080815)</p>
